(19, 'Cập nhập', 'update', 'Modules\\Courses\\src\\Models\\Courses', 26, 'BigK (Học viên)', 1, '{\"old\":{\"id\":26,\"name\":\"L\\u00e0m ch\\u1ee7 Docker t\\u1eeb c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n \\u0111\\u1ebfn n\\u00e2ng cao\",\"name_en\":\"Master Docker from basic to advanced.\",\"name_ko\":null,\"name_ja\":null,\"name_zh\":null,\"slug\":\"lam-chu-docker-tu-co-ban-den-nang-cao\",\"slug_en\":\"master-docker-from-basic-to-advanced\",\"slug_ko\":null,\"slug_ja\":null,\"slug_zh\":null,\"detail\":\"<p><strong>B\\u1ea1n l&agrave; l\\u1eadp tr&igrave;nh vi&ecirc;n, DevOps, hay sinh vi&ecirc;n CNTT \\u0111ang mu\\u1ed1n hi\\u1ec3u v&agrave; s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng Docker m\\u1ed9t c&aacute;ch b&agrave;i b\\u1ea3n?<\\/strong>&nbsp;\\u0110&acirc;y ch&iacute;nh l&agrave; kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc d&agrave;nh cho b\\u1ea1n!<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><strong>Trong kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc n&agrave;y, b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>-&nbsp;<strong>Hi\\u1ec3u b\\u1ea3n ch\\u1ea5t Docker<\\/strong>: Container l&agrave; g&igrave;, t\\u1ea1i sao n&ecirc;n d&ugrave;ng Docker thay v&igrave; c&agrave;i m&ocirc;i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng th\\u1ee7 c&ocirc;ng? So s&aacute;nh v\\u1edbi m&aacute;y \\u1ea3o, c&aacute;ch Docker qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; t&agrave;i nguy&ecirc;n, layer image&hellip;<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>-&nbsp;<strong>Th\\u1ef1c h&agrave;nh t\\u1eeb \\u0111\\u1ea7u<\\/strong>: C&agrave;i \\u0111\\u1eb7t Docker tr&ecirc;n Windows, MacOS, WSL, Ubuntu. S\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng c&aacute;c l\\u1ec7nh&nbsp;<code>run<\\/code>,&nbsp;<code>exec<\\/code>,&nbsp;<code>logs<\\/code>,&nbsp;<code>volume<\\/code>,&nbsp;<code>network<\\/code>,&nbsp;<code>build<\\/code>,&nbsp;<code>push<\\/code>... m\\u1ed9t c&aacute;ch th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>-&nbsp;<strong>X&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng image theo chu\\u1ea9n production<\\/strong>: Vi\\u1ebft Dockerfile chuy&ecirc;n nghi\\u1ec7p, t\\u1ed1i \\u01b0u dung l\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng, multi-stage build, qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; bi\\u1ebfn m&ocirc;i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng v&agrave; b\\u1ea3o m\\u1eadt<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>-&nbsp;<strong>Docker Compose<\\/strong>: T\\u1ed5 ch\\u1ee9c nhi\\u1ec1u container, chia microservices, c\\u1ea5u h&igrave;nh m&ocirc;i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng dev\\/test\\/prod ch\\u1ec9 v\\u1edbi m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ec7nh&nbsp;<code>docker-compose up<\\/code>.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>-&nbsp;<strong>Volume, Network, Mounts<\\/strong>: Hi\\u1ec3u s&acirc;u c&aacute;ch Docker qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u, li&ecirc;n k\\u1ebft gi\\u1eefa c&aacute;c container v&agrave; v\\u1edbi host<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><strong>- Tri\\u1ec3n khai th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf<\\/strong>: D\\u1ef1 &aacute;n m\\u1eabu tri\\u1ec3n khai app Node.js\\/PHP + MySQL\\/Redis + Nginx tr&ecirc;n Docker t\\u1eeb A \\u0111\\u1ebfn Z<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><strong>Kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc ph&ugrave; h\\u1ee3p v\\u1edbi ai?<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- L\\u1eadp tr&igrave;nh vi&ecirc;n web mu\\u1ed1n tri\\u1ec3n khai app g\\u1ecdn nh\\u1eb9, d\\u1ec5 maintain<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Sinh vi&ecirc;n IT mu\\u1ed1n n\\u1eafm b\\u1eaft xu h\\u01b0\\u1edbng dev hi\\u1ec7n \\u0111\\u1ea1i<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- DevOps c\\u1ea7n qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; h\\u1ea1 t\\u1ea7ng hi\\u1ec7u qu\\u1ea3<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- B\\u1ea5t k\\u1ef3 ai mu\\u1ed1n hi\\u1ec3u b\\u1ea3n ch\\u1ea5t container &amp; Docker<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><strong>Y&ecirc;u c\\u1ea7u \\u0111\\u1ea7u v&agrave;o:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- \\u0110&atilde; bi\\u1ebft c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n v\\u1ec1 l\\u1eadp tr&igrave;nh (PHP, Node.js, Python, v.v.)<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- \\u0110&atilde; t\\u1eebng deploy web app th\\u1ee7 c&ocirc;ng l&agrave; m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ee3i th\\u1ebf<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Ki\\u1ebfn th\\u1ee9c Linux c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><strong>H\\u1ecdc qua video Elearning + T&agrave;i li\\u1ec7u chi ti\\u1ebft + H\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 1-1<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>H\\u1ecdc xong b\\u1ea1n c&oacute; th\\u1ec3 t\\u1ef1 tin:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Vi\\u1ebft Dockerfile chu\\u1ea9n cho b\\u1ea5t k\\u1ef3 d\\u1ef1 &aacute;n n&agrave;o<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- T\\u1ef1 t\\u1ea1o m&ocirc;i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng dev\\/test\\/prod b\\u1eb1ng Docker Compose<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Debug, t\\u1ed1i \\u01b0u, tri\\u1ec3n khai \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng b\\u1eb1ng Docker chuy&ecirc;n nghi\\u1ec7p<\\/p>\",\"detail_en\":\"<p>Are you a programmer, DevOps specialist, or IT student looking to understand and use Docker systematically? This course is for you!<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>In this course, you will:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Understand the fundamentals of Docker: What are containers, why use Docker instead of manually setting up an environment? Compare it to virtual machines, how Docker manages resources, image layers, etc.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Practice from scratch: Install Docker on Windows, MacOS, WSL, Ubuntu. Use commands like run, exec, logs, volume, network, build, push... in a practical way.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Build production-standard images: Write professional Dockerfiles, optimize size, multi-stage build, manage environment variables, and ensure security.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Docker Compose: Organize multiple containers, divide microservices, and configure dev\\/test\\/prod environments with just one command: `docker-compose up`.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Volume, Network, Mounts: Gain a deep understanding of how Docker manages data, the connections between containers and with the host.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Practical Deployment: A sample project deploying a Node.js\\/PHP + MySQL\\/Redis + Nginx app on Docker from A to Z.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Who is this course suitable for?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Web developers who want to deploy lightweight, easy-to-maintain apps<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- IT students who want to grasp modern development trends<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- DevOps professionals who need to manage infrastructure efficiently<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Anyone who wants to understand the nature of containers &amp; Docker<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Entry requirements:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Basic programming knowledge (PHP, Node.js, Python, etc.)<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Experience deploying web apps manually is an advantage<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Basic Linux knowledge<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Learning via Elearning videos + Detailed documentation + 1-on-1 support<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>After completing the course, you can confidently:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Write standard Dockerfiles for any project<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Create your own development\\/testing\\/production environments using Docker Compose<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Debugging, optimizing, and deploying applications professionally using Docker<\\/p>\",\"detail_ko\":null,\"detail_ja\":null,\"detail_zh\":null,\"teacher_id\":6,\"thumbnail\":\"\\/storage\\/photos\\/2\\/t\\u1ea3i xu\\u1ed1ng (7).jfif\",\"price\":1995000,\"sale_price\":795000,\"code\":\"KH338256\",\"durations\":0,\"is_document\":0,\"supports\":\"<p>H\\u1ecdc tr&ecirc;n m\\u1ecdi thi\\u1ebft b\\u1ecb<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Code m\\u1eabu, t&agrave;i li\\u1ec7u \\u0111\\u1ea7y \\u0111\\u1ee7<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>H\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 1-1 b\\u1edfi gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n, nh&oacute;m k&iacute;n<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Gi\\u1edbi thi\\u1ec7u c&ocirc;ng vi\\u1ec7c ph&ugrave; h\\u1ee3p<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Th\\u1eddi h\\u1ea1n: V\\u0129nh vi\\u1ec5n<\\/p>\",\"supports_en\":\"<p>Learn on any device<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Sample code, complete documentation<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>One-on-one support by instructors, private group<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Job placement assistance<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Duration: Lifetime<\\/p>\",\"supports_ko\":\"<p>\\ubaa8\\ub4e0 \\uae30\\uae30\\uc5d0\\uc11c \\ud559\\uc2b5 \\uac00\\ub2a5<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u3059\\u3079\\u3066\\u306e\\u30c7\\u30d0\\u30a4\\u30b9\\u3067\\u5b66\\u7fd2\\u53ef\\u80fd<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\uc608\\uc81c \\ucf54\\ub4dc \\ubc0f \\uc644\\uc804\\ud55c \\ud559\\uc2b5 \\uc790\\ub8cc \\uc81c\\uacf5<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\uac15\\uc0ac\\uc758 1:1 \\uc9c0\\uc6d0 \\ubc0f \\uc804\\uc6a9 \\ucee4\\ubba4\\ub2c8\\ud2f0<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\uc5ed\\ub7c9\\uc5d0 \\ub9de\\ub294 \\ucde8\\uc5c5 \\uae30\\ud68c \\uc81c\\uacf5<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud3c9\\uc0dd \\uc774\\uc6a9 \\uac00\\ub2a5<\\/p>\",\"supports_ja\":null,\"supports_zh\":null,\"status\":1,\"view\":3,\"created_at\":\"2026-02-03T09:11:03.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-04T13:20:52.000000Z\",\"teacher\":{\"id\":6,\"name\":\"Gi\\u1ea3ng vi\\u00ean \\u1ea3o\",\"name_en\":\"Virtual Instructor\",\"name_ko\":\"\\uac00\\uc0c1 \\uac15\\uc0ac\",\"name_ja\":\"\\u30d0\\u30fc\\u30c1\\u30e3\\u30eb\\u8b1b\\u5e2b\",\"name_zh\":\"\\u865a\\u62df\\u8bb2\\u5e08\",\"slug\":\"giang-vien-ao\",\"slug_en\":\"virtual-instructor\",\"slug_ko\":\"\\uac00\\uc0c1-\\uac15\\uc0ac\",\"slug_ja\":\"\\u30d0\\u30fc\\u30c1\\u30e3\\u30eb\\u8b1b\\u5e2b\",\"slug_zh\":\"\\u865a\\u62df\\u8bb2\\u5e08\",\"description\":\"<p><span style=\\\"color:#e74c3c\\\">Fullstack Developer<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o l&agrave; gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n Fullstack v\\u1edbi nhi\\u1ec1u n\\u0103m kinh nghi\\u1ec7m trong l\\u0129nh v\\u1ef1c ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m v&agrave; \\u0111&agrave;o t\\u1ea1o l\\u1eadp tr&igrave;nh vi&ecirc;n t\\u1eeb c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n \\u0111\\u1ebfn n&acirc;ng cao. Anh t\\u1eebng tr\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ebfp tham gia x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng v&agrave; tri\\u1ec3n khai nhi\\u1ec1u d\\u1ef1 &aacute;n web th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf, t\\u1eeb c&aacute;c h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng website doanh nghi\\u1ec7p, n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng th\\u01b0\\u01a1ng m\\u1ea1i \\u0111i\\u1ec7n t\\u1eed \\u0111\\u1ebfn c&aacute;c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; v&agrave; h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng n\\u1ed9i b\\u1ed9.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>V\\u1edbi n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng v\\u1eefng ch\\u1eafc c\\u1ea3 Front-end v&agrave; Back-end, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o c&oacute; kh\\u1ea3 n\\u0103ng h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn h\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n ti\\u1ebfp c\\u1eadn l\\u1eadp tr&igrave;nh m\\u1ed9t c&aacute;ch b&agrave;i b\\u1ea3n, hi\\u1ec3u r&otilde; b\\u1ea3n ch\\u1ea5t v\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1 thay v&igrave; ch\\u1ec9 l&agrave;m theo m\\u1eabu. N\\u1ed9i dung gi\\u1ea3ng d\\u1ea1y lu&ocirc;n b&aacute;m s&aacute;t nhu c\\u1ea7u th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf c\\u1ee7a doanh nghi\\u1ec7p, c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7 m\\u1edbi v&agrave; t\\u1eadp trung m\\u1ea1nh v&agrave;o k\\u1ef9 n\\u0103ng th\\u1ef1c h&agrave;nh, gi&uacute;p h\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n c&oacute; th\\u1ec3 t\\u1ef1 x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m ho&agrave;n ch\\u1ec9nh ngay trong qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh h\\u1ecdc.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Trong vai tr&ograve; gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t ch&uacute; tr\\u1ecdng \\u0111\\u1ebfn tr\\u1ea3i nghi\\u1ec7m h\\u1ecdc t\\u1eadp c\\u1ee7a h\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n. C&aacute;c b&agrave;i gi\\u1ea3ng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, d\\u1ec5 hi\\u1ec3u, k\\u1ebft h\\u1ee3p gi\\u1eefa l&yacute; thuy\\u1ebft c\\u1ed1t l&otilde;i v&agrave; b&agrave;i t\\u1eadp th\\u1ef1c h&agrave;nh th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf. H\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n kh&ocirc;ng ch\\u1ec9 h\\u1ecdc c&aacute;ch vi\\u1ebft code, m&agrave; c&ograve;n \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn t\\u01b0 duy gi\\u1ea3i quy\\u1ebft v\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1, c&aacute;ch t\\u1ed5 ch\\u1ee9c source code, l&agrave;m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi database, API, c\\u0169ng nh\\u01b0 quy tr&igrave;nh ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m chuy&ecirc;n nghi\\u1ec7p.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>B&ecirc;n c\\u1ea1nh vi\\u1ec7c gi\\u1ea3ng d\\u1ea1y, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o lu&ocirc;n khuy\\u1ebfn kh&iacute;ch h\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n ch\\u1ee7 \\u0111\\u1ed9ng h\\u1ecdc h\\u1ecfi, t\\u1ef1 nghi&ecirc;n c\\u1ee9u v&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng ng\\u1ea1i th\\u1eed nghi\\u1ec7m. Anh tin r\\u1eb1ng l\\u1eadp tr&igrave;nh kh&ocirc;ng ch\\u1ec9 l&agrave; k\\u1ef9 n\\u0103ng k\\u1ef9 thu\\u1eadt, m&agrave; c&ograve;n l&agrave; t\\u01b0 duy logic v&agrave; kh\\u1ea3 n\\u0103ng th&iacute;ch nghi v\\u1edbi s\\u1ef1 thay \\u0111\\u1ed5i c\\u1ee7a c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7. M\\u1ee5c ti&ecirc;u c\\u1ee7a anh l&agrave; gi&uacute;p h\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng v\\u1eefng ch\\u1eafc, \\u0111\\u1ee7 t\\u1ef1 tin \\u0111\\u1ec3 ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1ee5c ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n s\\u1ef1 nghi\\u1ec7p trong l\\u0129nh v\\u1ef1c c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7 th&ocirc;ng tin ho\\u1eb7c tham gia v&agrave;o c&aacute;c d\\u1ef1 &aacute;n th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf ngay sau khi ho&agrave;n th&agrave;nh kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc.<\\/p>\",\"description_en\":\"<p><span style=\\\"color:#e74c3c\\\">Fullstack Developer<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o is a Fullstack instructor with many years of experience in software development and training programmers from basic to advanced levels. He has directly participated in building and deploying many real-world web projects, from corporate websites and e-commerce platforms to management applications and internal systems.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>With a solid foundation in both Front-end and Back-end development, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o is able to guide students to approach programming in a systematic way, understanding the essence of the problem rather than just following a template. The teaching content always closely follows the real-world needs of businesses, updates new technologies, and strongly focuses on practical skills, helping students build complete products themselves during the learning process.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>As an instructor, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o places particular emphasis on the learning experience of his students. Lectures are designed to be clear, easy to understand, combining core theory with practical exercises. Students not only learn how to write code, but are also guided in problem-solving thinking, source code organization, working with databases and APIs, as well as professional software development processes.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Besides teaching, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o always encourages students to proactively learn, conduct their own research, and not be afraid to experiment. He believes that programming is not just about technical skills, but also about logical thinking and the ability to adapt to technological changes. His goal is to help students build a solid foundation, giving them enough confidence to continue developing their careers in information technology or participate in real-world projects immediately after completing the course.<\\/p>\",\"description_ko\":\"<p><strong>\\ud480\\uc2a4\\ud0dd \\uac1c\\ubc1c\\uc790<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><strong>\\uac00\\uc0c1 \\uac15\\uc0ac<\\/strong>\\ub294 \\uc18c\\ud504\\ud2b8\\uc6e8\\uc5b4 \\uac1c\\ubc1c \\ubd84\\uc57c\\uc5d0\\uc11c \\ub2e4\\ub144\\uac04\\uc758 \\uacbd\\ud5d8\\uc744 \\ubcf4\\uc720\\ud55c \\ud480\\uc2a4\\ud0dd \\uac1c\\ubc1c\\uc790\\ub85c, \\ucd08\\uae09\\ubd80\\ud130 \\uace0\\uae09\\uae4c\\uc9c0 \\ud504\\ub85c\\uadf8\\ub798\\uba38 \\uad50\\uc721\\uc744 \\uc9c4\\ud589\\ud574 \\uc654\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\uadf8\\ub294 \\uae30\\uc5c5 \\uc6f9\\uc0ac\\uc774\\ud2b8, \\uc804\\uc790\\uc0c1\\uac70\\ub798 \\ud50c\\ub7ab\\ud3fc, \\uad00\\ub9ac \\uc2dc\\uc2a4\\ud15c \\ubc0f \\ub0b4\\ubd80 \\uc2dc\\uc2a4\\ud15c \\ub4f1 \\ub2e4\\uc591\\ud55c \\uc2e4\\uc81c \\uc6f9 \\ud504\\ub85c\\uc81d\\ud2b8\\ub97c \\uc9c1\\uc811 \\uad6c\\ucd95\\ud558\\uace0 \\uc6b4\\uc601\\ud55c \\uacbd\\ud5d8\\uc774 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\ud504\\ub860\\ud2b8\\uc5d4\\ub4dc\\uc640 \\ubc31\\uc5d4\\ub4dc \\ubaa8\\ub450\\uc5d0 \\ub300\\ud55c \\ud0c4\\ud0c4\\ud55c \\uae30\\ubc18\\uc744 \\ubc14\\ud0d5\\uc73c\\ub85c, \\uac00\\uc0c1 \\uac15\\uc0ac\\ub294 \\ud559\\uc2b5\\uc790\\ub4e4\\uc774 \\ub2e8\\uc21c\\ud788 \\uc608\\uc81c\\ub97c \\ub530\\ub77c \\ud558\\ub294 \\uac83\\uc774 \\uc544\\ub2c8\\ub77c \\ud504\\ub85c\\uadf8\\ub798\\ubc0d\\uc758 \\ubcf8\\uc9c8\\uc744 \\uc774\\ud574\\ud558\\uba70 \\uccb4\\uacc4\\uc801\\uc73c\\ub85c \\uc811\\uadfc\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\ub3c4\\ub85d \\uc9c0\\ub3c4\\ud569\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\uac1