(26, 'Cập nhập', 'update', 'Modules\\Courses\\src\\Models\\Courses', 23, 'BigK (Học viên)', 1, '{\"old\":{\"id\":23,\"name\":\"L\\u1eadp tr\\u00ecnh App Mobile v\\u1edbi React Native + TypeScript\",\"name_en\":\"Mobile App Development with React Native + TypeScript\",\"name_ko\":null,\"name_ja\":null,\"name_zh\":null,\"slug\":\"lap-trinh-app-mobile-voi-react-native-typescript\",\"slug_en\":\"mobile-app-development-with-react-native-typescript\",\"slug_ko\":null,\"slug_ja\":null,\"slug_zh\":null,\"detail\":\"<p><strong>B\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng chuy&ecirc;n nghi\\u1ec7p ch\\u1ea1y tr&ecirc;n c\\u1ea3 iOS v&agrave; Android m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; ki\\u1ebfn th\\u1ee9c l\\u1eadp tr&igrave;nh Native?<\\/strong>&nbsp;Kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc&nbsp;<em>L&agrave;m ch\\u1ee7 React Native t\\u1eeb c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n \\u0111\\u1ebfn chuy&ecirc;n s&acirc;u<\\/em>&nbsp;l&agrave; l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn ho&agrave;n h\\u1ea3o cho ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi m\\u1edbi b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u! V\\u1edbi l\\u1ed9 tr&igrave;nh chi ti\\u1ebft, th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf v&agrave; t\\u1eadp trung v&agrave;o th\\u1ef1c h&agrave;nh, b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd \\u0111i t\\u1eeb con s\\u1ed1 0 \\u0111\\u1ebfn vi\\u1ec7c t\\u1ef1 tin ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng ho&agrave;n ch\\u1ec9nh.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><strong>B\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd h\\u1ecdc \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c g&igrave;?<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><strong>- N\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng l\\u1eadp tr&igrave;nh React:&nbsp;<\\/strong>\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c &ocirc;n t\\u1eadp l\\u1ea1i v\\u1ec1 n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng ReactJS \\u0111\\u1ec3 chu\\u1ea9n b\\u1ecb h&agrave;nh trang cho l\\u1eadp tr&igrave;nh React Native<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><strong>- X&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng giao di\\u1ec7n<\\/strong>: S\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng c&aacute;c th&agrave;nh ph\\u1ea7n c\\u1ed1t l&otilde;i c\\u1ee7a React Native \\u0111\\u1ec3 thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf UI responsive, \\u0111\\u1eb9p m\\u1eaft.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><strong>- \\u0110i\\u1ec1u h\\u01b0\\u1edbng v&agrave; qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; tr\\u1ea1ng th&aacute;i<\\/strong>: T\\u1ea1o \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng \\u0111a m&agrave;n h&igrave;nh v\\u1edbi navigation m\\u01b0\\u1ee3t m&agrave;, qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u hi\\u1ec7u qu\\u1ea3 b\\u1eb1ng hooks v&agrave; Redux.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><strong>- T&iacute;ch h\\u1ee3p API v&agrave; t&iacute;nh n\\u0103ng thi\\u1ebft b\\u1ecb<\\/strong>: K\\u1ebft n\\u1ed1i backend, s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng camera, \\u0111\\u1ecbnh v\\u1ecb GPS, push notifications \\u0111\\u1ec3 t\\u1ea1o app th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><strong>- T\\u1ed1i \\u01b0u h&oacute;a v&agrave; tri\\u1ec3n khai<\\/strong>: H\\u1ecdc c&aacute;ch t\\u1ed1i \\u01b0u hi\\u1ec7u su\\u1ea5t, debug, test v&agrave; \\u0111\\u01b0a \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng l&ecirc;n Google Play\\/App Store.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><strong>- D\\u1ef1 &aacute;n th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf<\\/strong>: X&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng ho&agrave;n ch\\u1ec9nh (nh\\u01b0 app e-commerce ho\\u1eb7c m\\u1ea1ng x&atilde; h\\u1ed9i) \\u0111\\u1ec3 l&agrave;m portfolio.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><strong>\\u0110\\u1ed1i t\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng ph&ugrave; h\\u1ee3p<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">- Ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi m\\u1edbi b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u ti\\u1ebfp c\\u1eadn v\\u1edbi l\\u1eadp tr&igrave;nh Mobile<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">- Sinh vi&ecirc;n, ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi chuy\\u1ec3n ngh\\u1ec1 ho\\u1eb7c l\\u1eadp tr&igrave;nh vi&ecirc;n mu\\u1ed1n h\\u1ecdc ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng cross-platform.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">- Nh\\u1eefng ai mu\\u1ed1n x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng mobile \\u0111\\u1ec3 l&agrave;m vi\\u1ec7c freelance ho\\u1eb7c startup.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><strong>T\\u1ea1i sao ch\\u1ecdn kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc n&agrave;y?<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><strong>- H\\u1ecdc t\\u1eeb con s\\u1ed1 0<\\/strong>: Kh&ocirc;ng c\\u1ea7n n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng, l\\u1ed9 tr&igrave;nh \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf d\\u1ec5 hi\\u1ec3u, t\\u1eebng b\\u01b0\\u1edbc.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><strong>- Th\\u1ef1c h&agrave;nh th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf<\\/strong>: Code tr\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ebfp, test tr&ecirc;n thi\\u1ebft b\\u1ecb th\\u1eadt, d\\u1ef1 &aacute;n s&aacute;t v\\u1edbi nhu c\\u1ea7u doanh nghi\\u1ec7p.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><strong>- H\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 Elearning<\\/strong>: Video b&agrave;i gi\\u1ea3ng r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, t&agrave;i li\\u1ec7u chi ti\\u1ebft, b&agrave;i t\\u1eadp v&agrave; code m\\u1eabu.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><strong>- H\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 tr\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1eeb gi\\u1ea3ng<\\/strong>: Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n h\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 tr\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ebfp \\u0111\\u1ec3 gi\\u1ea3i \\u0111&aacute;p c&aacute;c th\\u1eafc m\\u1eafc<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><strong>Y&ecirc;u c\\u1ea7u<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">- M&aacute;y t&iacute;nh (Windows\\/Mac\\/Linux) v\\u1edbi Node.js v&agrave; VS Code.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">- \\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i Android\\/iOS \\u0111\\u1ec3 test (khuy\\u1ebfn kh&iacute;ch, kh&ocirc;ng b\\u1eaft bu\\u1ed9c).<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">- \\u0110am m&ecirc; h\\u1ecdc h\\u1ecfi v&agrave; s\\u1eb5n s&agrave;ng d&agrave;nh 8-10 gi\\u1edd\\/tu\\u1ea7n \\u0111\\u1ec3 h\\u1ecdc v&agrave; th\\u1ef1c h&agrave;nh.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><strong>K\\u1ebft qu\\u1ea3 sau kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">- X&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng mobile ho&agrave;n ch\\u1ec9nh, s\\u1eb5n s&agrave;ng publish l&ecirc;n store.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">- N\\u1eafm v\\u1eefng React Native, s\\u1eb5n s&agrave;ng l&agrave;m vi\\u1ec7c th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf ho\\u1eb7c ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n d\\u1ef1 &aacute;n c&aacute; nh&acirc;n.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">- S\\u1edf h\\u1eefu portfolio v\\u1edbi d\\u1ef1 &aacute;n th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf \\u0111\\u1ec3 \\u1ee9ng tuy\\u1ec3n ho\\u1eb7c l&agrave;m freelance.<\\/p>\",\"detail_en\":\"<p>Want to build a professional mobile app that runs on both iOS and Android without any native programming knowledge? The &quot;Mastering React Native from Basic to Advanced&quot; course is the perfect choice for beginners! With a detailed, practical, and hands-on learning path, you&#39;ll go from zero to confidently developing complete mobile applications.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>What will you learn?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- React programming foundation: Review ReactJS to prepare for React Native programming.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- UI development: Use core React Native components to design responsive and visually appealing UI.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Navigation and state management: Create multi-screen applications with smooth navigation and efficient data management using hooks and Redux.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- API and device integration: Connect the backend, use the camera, GPS location, and push notifications to create a practical app.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Optimization and Deployment: Learn how to optimize performance, debug, test, and publish your application to Google Play\\/App Store.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Real-world Project: Build a complete application (such as an e-commerce or social media app) to create a portfolio.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Suitable for:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Beginners in mobile programming<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Students, career changers, or programmers who want to learn cross-platform application development.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Those who want to build mobile applications for freelance work or startups.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Why choose this course?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Learn from scratch: No prior knowledge required, easy-to-understand, step-by-step learning path.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Hands-on practice: Code directly, test on real devices, projects closely aligned with business needs.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Elearning support: Clear video lectures, detailed documentation, exercises, and sample code.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Direct support from instructors: Instructors provide direct support to answer questions.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Requirements:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Computer (Windows\\/Mac\\/Linux) with Node.js and VS Code.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Android\\/iOS phone for testing (recommended, not required).<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Passion for learning and willingness to dedicate 8-10 hours per week to learning and practice.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Course Outcomes:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Build a complete mobile application, ready to publish to app stores.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Master React Native, ready for real-world work or personal project development.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>- Own a portfolio with real-world projects for job applications or freelance work.<\\/p>\",\"detail_ko\":null,\"detail_ja\":null,\"detail_zh\":null,\"teacher_id\":6,\"thumbnail\":\"\\/storage\\/photos\\/2\\/t\\u1ea3i xu\\u1ed1ng (2).png\",\"price\":2950000,\"sale_price\":895000,\"code\":\"KH296839\",\"durations\":0,\"is_document\":0,\"supports\":\"<p>H\\u1ecdc tr&ecirc;n m\\u1ecdi thi\\u1ebft b\\u1ecb<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Code m\\u1eabu, t&agrave;i li\\u1ec7u \\u0111\\u1ea7y \\u0111\\u1ee7<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>H\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 1-1 b\\u1edfi gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n, nh&oacute;m k&iacute;n<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Gi\\u1edbi thi\\u1ec7u c&ocirc;ng vi\\u1ec7c ph&ugrave; h\\u1ee3p<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Th\\u1eddi h\\u1ea1n: V\\u0129nh vi\\u1ec5n<\\/p>\",\"supports_en\":\"<p>Learn on any device<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Sample code, complete documentation<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>One-on-one support by instructors, private group<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Job placement assistance<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Duration: Lifetime<\\/p>\",\"supports_ko\":\"<p>\\ubaa8\\ub4e0 \\uae30\\uae30\\uc5d0\\uc11c \\ud559\\uc2b5 \\uac00\\ub2a5<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u3059\\u3079\\u3066\\u306e\\u30c7\\u30d0\\u30a4\\u30b9\\u3067\\u5b66\\u7fd2\\u53ef\\u80fd<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\uc608\\uc81c \\ucf54\\ub4dc \\ubc0f \\uc644\\uc804\\ud55c \\ud559\\uc2b5 \\uc790\\ub8cc \\uc81c\\uacf5<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\uac15\\uc0ac\\uc758 1:1 \\uc9c0\\uc6d0 \\ubc0f \\uc804\\uc6a9 \\ucee4\\ubba4\\ub2c8\\ud2f0<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\uc5ed\\ub7c9\\uc5d0 \\ub9de\\ub294 \\ucde8\\uc5c5 \\uae30\\ud68c \\uc81c\\uacf5<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud3c9\\uc0dd \\uc774\\uc6a9 \\uac00\\ub2a5<\\/p>\",\"supports_ja\":\"<p>\\u3059\\u3079\\u3066\\u306e\\u30c7\\u30d0\\u30a4\\u30b9\\u3067\\u5b66\\u7fd2\\u53ef\\u80fd<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u30b5\\u30f3\\u30d7\\u30eb\\u30b3\\u30fc\\u30c9\\u3068\\u5b8c\\u5168\\u306a\\u8cc7\\u6599\\u4ed8\\u304d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u8b1b\\u5e2b\\u306b\\u3088\\u308b1\\u5bfe1\\u30b5\\u30dd\\u30fc\\u30c8\\u3068\\u5c02\\u7528\\u30b3\\u30df\\u30e5\\u30cb\\u30c6\\u30a3<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u30b9\\u30ad\\u30eb\\u306b\\u5408\\u3063\\u305f\\u5c31\\u8077\\u6a5f\\u4f1a\\u306e\\u7d39\\u4ecb<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u7121\\u671f\\u9650\\u30a2\\u30af\\u30bb\\u30b9<\\/p>\",\"supports_zh\":\"<p>\\u652f\\u6301\\u5728\\u6240\\u6709\\u8bbe\\u5907\\u4e0a\\u5b66\\u4e60<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u63d0\\u4f9b\\u793a\\u4f8b\\u4ee3\\u7801\\u548c\\u5b8c\\u6574\\u5b66\\u4e60\\u8d44\\u6599<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u8bb2\\u5e08\\u4e00\\u5bf9\\u4e00\\u6307\\u5bfc\\u53ca\\u4e13\\u5c5e\\u5b66\\u4e60\\u793e\\u7fa4<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u63a8\\u8350\\u9002\\u5408\\u7684\\u5de5\\u4f5c\\u673a\\u4f1a<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u6c38\\u4e45\\u8bbf\\u95ee<\\/p>\",\"status\":1,\"view\":3,\"created_at\":\"2026-02-03T09:07:40.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-12T15:56:08.000000Z\",\"teacher\":{\"id\":6,\"name\":\"Gi\\u1ea3ng vi\\u00ean \\u1ea3o\",\"name_en\":\"Virtual Instructor\",\"name_ko\":\"\\uac00\\uc0c1 \\uac15\\uc0ac\",\"name_ja\":\"\\u30d0\\u30fc\\u30c1\\u30e3\\u30eb\\u8b1b\\u5e2b\",\"name_zh\":\"\\u865a\\u62df\\u8bb2\\u5e08\",\"slug\":\"giang-vien-ao\",\"slug_en\":\"virtual-instructor\",\"slug_ko\":\"\\uac00\\uc0c1-\\uac15\\uc0ac\",\"slug_ja\":\"\\u30d0\\u30fc\\u30c1\\u30e3\\u30eb\\u8b1b\\u5e2b\",\"slug_zh\":\"\\u865a\\u62df\\u8bb2\\u5e08\",\"description\":\"<p><span style=\\\"color:#e74c3c\\\">Fullstack Developer<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o l&agrave; gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n Fullstack v\\u1edbi nhi\\u1ec1u n\\u0103m kinh nghi\\u1ec7m trong l\\u0129nh v\\u1ef1c ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m v&agrave; \\u0111&agrave;o t\\u1ea1o l\\u1eadp tr&igrave;nh vi&ecirc;n t\\u1eeb c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n \\u0111\\u1ebfn n&acirc;ng cao. Anh t\\u1eebng tr\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ebfp tham gia x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng v&agrave; tri\\u1ec3n khai nhi\\u1ec1u d\\u1ef1 &aacute;n web th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf, t\\u1eeb c&aacute;c h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng website doanh nghi\\u1ec7p, n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng th\\u01b0\\u01a1ng m\\u1ea1i \\u0111i\\u1ec7n t\\u1eed \\u0111\\u1ebfn c&aacute;c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; v&agrave; h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng n\\u1ed9i b\\u1ed9.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>V\\u1edbi n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng v\\u1eefng ch\\u1eafc c\\u1ea3 Front-end v&agrave; Back-end, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o c&oacute; kh\\u1ea3 n\\u0103ng h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn h\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n ti\\u1ebfp c\\u1eadn l\\u1eadp tr&igrave;nh m\\u1ed9t c&aacute;ch b&agrave;i b\\u1ea3n, hi\\u1ec3u r&otilde; b\\u1ea3n ch\\u1ea5t v\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1 thay v&igrave; ch\\u1ec9 l&agrave;m theo m\\u1eabu. N\\u1ed9i dung gi\\u1ea3ng d\\u1ea1y lu&ocirc;n b&aacute;m s&aacute;t nhu c\\u1ea7u th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf c\\u1ee7a doanh nghi\\u1ec7p, c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7 m\\u1edbi v&agrave; t\\u1eadp trung m\\u1ea1nh v&agrave;o k\\u1ef9 n\\u0103ng th\\u1ef1c h&agrave;nh, gi&uacute;p h\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n c&oacute; th\\u1ec3 t\\u1ef1 x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m ho&agrave;n ch\\u1ec9nh ngay trong qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh h\\u1ecdc.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Trong vai tr&ograve; gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t ch&uacute; tr\\u1ecdng \\u0111\\u1ebfn tr\\u1ea3i nghi\\u1ec7m h\\u1ecdc t\\u1eadp c\\u1ee7a h\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n. C&aacute;c b&agrave;i gi\\u1ea3ng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, d\\u1ec5 hi\\u1ec3u, k\\u1ebft h\\u1ee3p gi\\u1eefa l&yacute; thuy\\u1ebft c\\u1ed1t l&otilde;i v&agrave; b&agrave;i t\\u1eadp th\\u1ef1c h&agrave;nh th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf. H\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n kh&ocirc;ng ch\\u1ec9 h\\u1ecdc c&aacute;ch vi\\u1ebft code, m&agrave; c&ograve;n \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn t\\u01b0 duy gi\\u1ea3i quy\\u1ebft v\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1, c&aacute;ch t\\u1ed5 ch\\u1ee9c source code, l&agrave;m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi database, API, c\\u0169ng nh\\u01b0 quy tr&igrave;nh ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m chuy&ecirc;n nghi\\u1ec7p.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>B&ecirc;n c\\u1ea1nh vi\\u1ec7c gi\\u1ea3ng d\\u1ea1y, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o lu&ocirc;n khuy\\u1ebfn kh&iacute;ch h\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n ch\\u1ee7 \\u0111\\u1ed9ng h\\u1ecdc h\\u1ecfi, t\\u1ef1 nghi&ecirc;n c\\u1ee9u v&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng ng\\u1ea1i th\\u1eed nghi\\u1ec7m. Anh tin r\\u1eb1ng l\\u1eadp tr&igrave;nh kh&ocirc;ng ch\\u1ec9 l&agrave; k\\u1ef9 n\\u0103ng k\\u1ef9 thu\\u1eadt, m&agrave; c&ograve;n l&agrave; t\\u01b0 duy logic v&agrave; kh\\u1ea3 n\\u0103ng th&iacute;ch nghi v\\u1edbi s\\u1ef1 thay \\u0111\\u1ed5i c\\u1ee7a c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7. M\\u1ee5c ti&ecirc;u c\\u1ee7a anh l&agrave; gi&uacute;p h\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng v\\u1eefng ch\\u1eafc, \\u0111\\u1ee7 t\\u1ef1 tin \\u0111\\u1ec3 ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1ee5c ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n s\\u1ef1 nghi\\u1ec7p trong l\\u0129nh v\\u1ef1c c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7 th&ocirc;ng tin ho\\u1eb7c tham gia v&agrave;o c&aacute;c d\\u1ef1 &aacute;n th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf ngay sau khi ho&agrave;n th&agrave;nh kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc.<\\/p>\",\"description_en\":\"<p><span style=\\\"color:#e74c3c\\\">Fullstack Developer<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o is a Fullstack instructor with many years of experience in software development and training programmers from basic to advanced levels. He has directly participated in building and deploying many real-world web projects, from corporate websites and e-commerce platforms to management applications and internal systems.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>With a solid foundation in both Front-end and Back-end development, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o is able to guide students to approach programming in a systematic way, understanding the essence of the problem rather than just following a template. The teaching content always closely follows the real-world needs of businesses, updates new technologies, and strongly focuses on practical skills, helping students build complete products themselves during the learning process.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>As an instructor, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o places particular emphasis on the learning experience of his students. Lectures are designed to be clear, easy to understand, combining core theory with practical exercises. Students not only learn how to write code, but are also guided in problem-solving thinking, source code organization, working with databases and APIs, as well as professional software development processes.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Besides teaching, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o always encourages students to proactively learn, conduct their own research, and not be afraid to experiment. He believes that programming is not just about technical skills, but also about logical thinking and the ability to adapt to technological changes. His goal is to help students build a solid foundation, giving them enough confidence to continue developing their careers in information technology or participate in real-world projects immediately after completing the course.<\\/p>\",\"description_ko\":\"<p><strong>\\ud480\\uc2a4\\ud0dd \\uac1c\\ubc1c\\uc790<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><strong>\\uac00\\uc0c1 \\uac15\\uc0ac<\\/strong>\\ub294 \\uc18c\\ud504\\ud2b8\\uc6e8\\uc5b4 \\uac1