(36, 'Cập nhập', 'update', 'Modules\\Courses\\src\\Models\\Courses', 13, 'BigK (Học viên)', 1, '{\"old\":{\"id\":13,\"name\":\"L\\u1eadp tr\\u00ecnh Front-End v\\u1edbi NextJS 15 + TypeScript\",\"name_en\":\"Front-End Programming with NextJS 15 + TypeScript\",\"name_ko\":null,\"name_ja\":null,\"name_zh\":null,\"slug\":\"lap-trinh-front-end-voi-nextjs-15-typescript\",\"slug_en\":\"front-end-programming-with-nextjs-15-typescript\",\"slug_ko\":null,\"slug_ja\":null,\"slug_zh\":null,\"detail\":\"<p><strong>NextJS<\\/strong>&nbsp;l&agrave; framework m&atilde; ngu\\u1ed3n m\\u1edf \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng tr&ecirc;n n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng c\\u1ee7a React,&nbsp;\\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n b\\u1edfi Vercel, gi&uacute;p \\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n h&oacute;a vi\\u1ec7c x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng c&aacute;c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng web React, \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t l&agrave; c&aacute;c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng c&oacute; y&ecirc;u c\\u1ea7u cao v\\u1ec1 hi\\u1ec7u n\\u0103ng v&agrave; SEO. NextJS c&ograve;n \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c g\\u1ecdi l&agrave; Fullstack Web Framework (L&agrave;m \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c c\\u1ea3 Front-End v&agrave; Back-End)<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc n&agrave;y \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf b\\u1edfi&nbsp;<strong>Ho&agrave;ng An Unicode<\\/strong>&nbsp;nh\\u1eb1m gi&uacute;p b\\u1ea1n n\\u1eafm v\\u1eefng c&aacute;ch k\\u1ebft h\\u1ee3p NextJS v\\u1edbi TypeScript \\u0111\\u1ec3 ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n c&aacute;c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng web m\\u1ea1nh m\\u1ebd, t\\u1ed1i \\u01b0u h&oacute;a hi\\u1ec7u n\\u0103ng v&agrave; d\\u1ec5 b\\u1ea3o tr&igrave;. B\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd h\\u1ecdc t\\u1eeb c&aacute;c kh&aacute;i ni\\u1ec7m c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n \\u0111\\u1ebfn n&acirc;ng cao, v\\u1edbi c&aacute;c b&agrave;i gi\\u1ea3ng chi ti\\u1ebft v&agrave; c&aacute;c d\\u1ef1 &aacute;n th\\u1ef1c h&agrave;nh t\\u1eeb \\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n \\u0111\\u1ebfn ph\\u1ee9c t\\u1ea1p.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Cu\\u1ed1i kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng 1 d\\u1ef1 &aacute;n ho&agrave;n ch\\u1ec9nh ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n b\\u1eb1ng Framework NextJS.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><strong>T\\u1ed5ng quan d\\u1ef1 &aacute;n Notion Clone trong kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba&nbsp;<strong>Video gi\\u1edbi thi\\u1ec7u d\\u1ef1 &aacute;n Notion<\\/strong>:&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba&nbsp;<strong>Demo d\\u1ef1 &aacute;n<\\/strong>:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><strong>B\\u1ea1n nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c g&igrave; t\\u1ea1i kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc?<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Ki\\u1ebfn th\\u1ee9c TypeScript t\\u1eeb c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n \\u0111\\u1ebfn n&acirc;ng cao, \\u0111\\u1ee7 cho b\\u1ea1n l&agrave;m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi c&aacute;c d\\u1ef1 &aacute;n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng TypeScript<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Ki\\u1ebfn th\\u1ee9c b&agrave;i b\\u1ea3n&nbsp;v\\u1ec1 NextJS t\\u1eeb c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n \\u0111\\u1ebfn n&acirc;ng cao<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Bi\\u1ebft c&aacute;ch l&agrave;m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi Middleware trong NextJS v&agrave; \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba \\u1ee8ng d\\u1ee5ng Route Handler, Server Actions \\u0111\\u1ec3 gi\\u1ea3i quy\\u1ebft c&aacute;c b&agrave;i to&aacute;n ph&iacute;a Server<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Bi\\u1ebft c&aacute;ch Data Fetching \\u1edf Client v&agrave; Server trong NextJS<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Bi\\u1ebft c&aacute;ch &aacute;p d\\u1ee5ng s\\u1ee9c m\\u1ea1nh c\\u1ee7a Cache trong NextJS<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba K\\u1ef9 thu\\u1eadt l&agrave;m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi SWR \\u0111\\u1ec3 \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng&nbsp;Data Fetching<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba K\\u1ef9 thu\\u1eadt l&agrave;m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi Authentication trong NextJS<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba K\\u1ef9 thu\\u1eadt l&agrave;m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi th\\u01b0 vi\\u1ec7n NextAuth t\\u1eeb c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n \\u0111\\u1ebfn n&acirc;ng cao<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Thao t&aacute;c v\\u1edbi Database trong NextJS v\\u1edbi Prisma ORM<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba K\\u1ef9 thu\\u1eadt Route n&acirc;ng cao v&agrave; \\u0111a ng&ocirc;n ng\\u1eef trong NextJS<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Bi\\u1ebft c&aacute;ch t\\u1ed1i \\u01b0u h&oacute;a chuy&ecirc;n s&acirc;u trong NextJS<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba \\u1ee8ng d\\u1ee5ng Redux Toolkit, Redux Tookit Query \\u0111\\u1ec3 qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; Global State, Data Fetching<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba &Aacute;p d\\u1ee5ng WebSocket, th\\u01b0 vi\\u1ec7n Socket.io \\u0111\\u1ec3 gi\\u1ea3i quy\\u1ebft c&aacute;c b&agrave;i to&aacute;n Realtime<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba \\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c h\\u1ecdc Testing v&agrave; Debug trong NextJS th&ocirc;ng qua: Jest, Testing Libary,...<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba X&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng d\\u1ef1 &aacute;n Notion b&agrave;i b\\u1ea3n t\\u1eeb \\u0111\\u1ea7u \\u0111\\u1ebfn khi ho&agrave;n thi\\u1ec7n<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba V&agrave; r\\u1ea5t nhi\\u1ec1u ki\\u1ebfn th\\u1ee9c, c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7, th\\u01b0 vi\\u1ec7n ph\\u1ed5 bi\\u1ebfn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c chia s\\u1ebb trong kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><strong>C&acirc;u h\\u1ecfi th\\u01b0\\u1eddng g\\u1eb7p<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><em><strong>Kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc n&agrave;y c\\u1ea7n ki\\u1ebfn th\\u1ee9c n\\u1ec1n g&igrave; kh&ocirc;ng?<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>NextJS l&agrave; Framework c\\u1ee7a ReactJS n&ecirc;n c&aacute;c b\\u1ea1n c\\u1ea7n c&oacute; ki\\u1ebfn th\\u1ee9c n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng v\\u1ec1 ReactJS<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><em><strong>T&ocirc;i kh&ocirc;ng bi\\u1ebft v\\u1ec1 TypeScript c&oacute; h\\u1ecdc \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c kh&ocirc;ng?<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c, trong kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn v\\u1ec1 TypeScript t\\u1eeb \\u0111\\u1ea7u<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><em><strong>Trong qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh h\\u1ecdc, t&ocirc;i c&oacute; \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c h\\u1ecfi gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n kh&ocirc;ng?<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c, n\\u1ebfu g\\u1eb7p kh&oacute; kh\\u0103n b\\u1ea1n c&oacute; th\\u1ec3 nh\\u1eafn tin tr\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ebfp cho gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n qua Zalo ho\\u1eb7c tr&ecirc;n group \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c tham gia<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><em><strong>T&ocirc;i c\\u1ea7n c&agrave;i \\u0111\\u1eb7t nh\\u1eefng ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m\\/c&ocirc;ng c\\u1ee5 g&igrave; \\u0111\\u1ec3 h\\u1ecdc?<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u0110\\u1ec3 h\\u1ecdc NextJS&nbsp;b\\u1ea1n c\\u1ea7n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m Visual Studio Code \\u0111\\u1ec3 vi\\u1ebft code v&agrave; c&agrave;i \\u0111\\u1eb7t NodeJS tr&ecirc;n m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh. B\\u1ea1n c&oacute; th\\u1ec3 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m vi\\u1ebft code kh&aacute;c n\\u1ebfu ph&ugrave; h\\u1ee3p<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><em><strong>Trong b&agrave;i gi\\u1ea3ng b\\u1ea1n d&ugrave;ng ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m n&agrave;o \\u0111\\u1ec3 h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn h\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n?<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Trong kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc m&igrave;nh \\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m Visual Studio Code \\u0111\\u1ec3 vi\\u1ebft code, m&igrave;nh c\\u0169ng khuy&ecirc;n b\\u1ea1n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m n&agrave;y v&igrave; n&oacute; h\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 r\\u1ea5t m\\u1ea1nh cho Front-End<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><em><strong>Trong kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc \\u0111ang h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn \\u1edf phi&ecirc;n b\\u1ea3n NextJS&nbsp;bao nhi&ecirc;u?<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Trong kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc, m&igrave;nh h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn tr&ecirc;n NextJS 15<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><em><strong>Kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc n&agrave;y c&ograve;n ph&ugrave; h\\u1ee3p v\\u1edbi th\\u1eddi \\u0111i\\u1ec3m hi\\u1ec7n t\\u1ea1i kh&ocirc;ng?<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc r\\u1ea5t ph&ugrave; h\\u1ee3p v\\u1edbi th\\u1eddi \\u0111i\\u1ec3m hi\\u1ec7n t\\u1ea1i. V&igrave; hi\\u1ec7n t\\u1ea1i v\\u1eabn l&agrave; phi&ecirc;n b\\u1ea3n 15<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><em><strong>Kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc n&agrave;y c&oacute; \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt trong t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng lai kh&ocirc;ng?<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>C&oacute; b\\u1ea1n nh&eacute;. M&igrave;nh s\\u1ebd c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt nh\\u1eefng ki\\u1ebfn th\\u1ee9c m\\u1edbi, t\\u01b0 duy m\\u1edbi trong NextJS&nbsp;ph&ugrave; h\\u1ee3p v\\u1edbi nhu c\\u1ea7u tuy\\u1ec3n d\\u1ee5ng<\\/p>\",\"detail_en\":\"<p>NextJS is an open-source framework built on the React foundation, developed by Vercel, that simplifies the development of React web applications, especially those with high performance and SEO requirements. NextJS is also known as a Fullstack Web Framework (capable of both front-end and back-end development).<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>This course, designed by Hoang An Unicode, aims to help you master how to combine NextJS with TypeScript to develop powerful, performance-optimized, and easy-to-maintain web applications. You will learn from basic to advanced concepts, with detailed lectures and practical projects ranging from simple to complex.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>At the end of the course, you will be guided to build a complete project entirely using the NextJS framework.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Overview of the Notion Clone project in the course:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Video introducing the Notion project:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Project demo:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>What will you receive from the course?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Basic to advanced TypeScript knowledge, sufficient for working on TypeScript projects.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Comprehensive knowledge of NextJS from basic to advanced levels.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Understanding how to work with Middleware in NextJS and its practical applications.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Applying Route Handler and Server Actions to solve server-side problems.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Understanding client-side and server-side data fetching in NextJS.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Understanding how to leverage the power of caching in NextJS.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Techniques for working with SWR to implement data fetching.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Techniques for working with authentication in NextJS.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Techniques for working with the NextAuth library from basic to advanced levels.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Manipulating databases in NextJS with Prisma ORM.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Advanced and multi-language routing techniques in NextJS.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Understanding in-depth optimization in NextJS.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Applying Redux Toolkit and Redux. Query Toolkit for Global State Management and Data Fetching<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Applying WebSockets and the Socket.io library to solve real-time problems<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Learning Testing and Debugging in NextJS through: Jest, Testing Library, etc.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Building a systematic Notion project from start to finish<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba And much more knowledge, technologies, and popular libraries shared in the course<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Frequently Asked Questions<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>What prior knowledge is required for this course?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>NextJS is a ReactJS framework, so you need a foundation in ReactJS.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>I don&#39;t know TypeScript, can I still learn?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Yes, you will be taught TypeScript from the beginning in this course.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Can I ask the instructor questions during the course?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Yes, if you encounter difficulties, you can message the instructor directly via Zalo or in the group you are in.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>What software\\/tools do I need to install to learn?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>To learn NextJS, you need to use Visual Studio Code to write code and install Node.js on your computer. You can use other coding software if suitable.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>What software do you use to guide students in the course?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>In this course, I am using Visual Studio Code to write code. I also recommend this software because it provides strong support for front-end development.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>What version of NextJS is being taught in this course?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>In this course, I am teaching on NextJS 15.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Is this course still relevant today?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The course is very relevant today, as it is still version 15.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Will this course be updated in the future?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Yes, it will. I will update the course with new knowledge and new approaches in NextJS to meet recruitment needs.<\\/p>\",\"detail_ko\":null,\"detail_ja\":null,\"detail_zh\":null,\"teacher_id\":6,\"thumbnail\":\"\\/storage\\/photos\\/2\\/t\\u1ea3i xu\\u1ed1ng.png\",\"price\":2950000,\"sale_price\":995000,\"code\":\"KH319978\",\"durations\":0,\"is_document\":0,\"supports\":\"<p>H\\u1ecdc tr&ecirc;n m\\u1ecdi thi\\u1ebft b\\u1ecb<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Code m\\u1eabu, t&agrave;i li\\u1ec7u \\u0111\\u1ea7y \\u0111\\u1ee7<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>H\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 1-1 b\\u1edfi gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n, nh&oacute;m k&iacute;n<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Gi\\u1edbi thi\\u1ec7u c&ocirc;ng vi\\u1ec7c ph&ugrave; h\\u1ee3p<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Th\\u1eddi h\\u1ea1n: V\\u0129nh vi\\u1ec5n<\\/p>\",\"supports_en\":\"<p>Learn on any device<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Sample code, complete documentation<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>One-on-one support by instructors, private group<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Job placement assistance<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Duration: Lifetime<\\/p>\",\"supports_ko\":\"<p>\\ubaa8\\ub4e0 \\uae30\\uae30\\uc5d0\\uc11c \\ud559\\uc2b5 \\uac00\\ub2a5<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u3059\\u3079\\u3066\\u306e\\u30c7\\u30d0\\u30a4\\u30b9\\u3067\\u5b66\\u7fd2\\u53ef\\u80fd<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\uc608\\uc81c \\ucf54\\ub4dc \\ubc0f \\uc644\\uc804\\ud5