(37, 'Cập nhập', 'update', 'Modules\\Courses\\src\\Models\\Courses', 12, 'BigK (Học viên)', 1, '{\"old\":{\"id\":12,\"name\":\"L\\u1eadp tr\\u00ecnh Front-End v\\u1edbi ReactJS + TypeScript\",\"name_en\":\"Front-End Programming with ReactJS + TypeScript\",\"name_ko\":null,\"name_ja\":null,\"name_zh\":null,\"slug\":\"lap-trinh-front-end-voi-reactjs-typescript\",\"slug_en\":\"front-end-programming-with-reactjs-typescript\",\"slug_ko\":null,\"slug_ja\":null,\"slug_zh\":null,\"detail\":\"<p>ReactJS&nbsp;l&agrave; 1 th\\u01b0 vi\\u1ec7n JavaScript m&atilde; ngu\\u1ed3n m\\u1edf \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n b\\u1edfi \\u0111\\u1ed9i ng\\u0169 k\\u1ef9 s\\u01b0 \\u0111\\u1ebfn t\\u1eeb Facebook; n&oacute; \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c gi\\u1edbi thi\\u1ec7u v&agrave;o n\\u0103m 2011.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Nguy&ecirc;n l&yacute; x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng c\\u1ee7a React d\\u1ef1a tr&ecirc;n components (component-based approach), c&oacute; th\\u1ec3 t&aacute;i s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng v&agrave; ph&ugrave; h\\u1ee3p v\\u1edbi \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng 1 trang (Single Page Application &ndash; SPA). React gi&uacute;p l\\u1eadp tr&igrave;nh vi&ecirc;n x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng giao di\\u1ec7n ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d&ugrave;ng d\\u1ef1a tr&ecirc;n JSX (m&ocirc;t c&uacute; ph&aacute;p m\\u1edf r\\u1ed9ng c\\u1ee7a JavaScript), t\\u1ea1o ra c&aacute;c DOM \\u1ea3o (virtual DOM) \\u0111\\u1ec3 t\\u1ed1i \\u01b0u vi\\u1ec7c render 1 trang web.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><strong>Kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc ReactJS<\\/strong>&nbsp;\\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng v&agrave; h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn b\\u1edfi&nbsp;<strong>Ho&agrave;ng An Unicode<\\/strong>&nbsp;gi&uacute;p h\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n trang b\\u1ecb cho m&igrave;nh ki\\u1ebfn th\\u1ee9c c\\u1ea7n thi\\u1ebft nh\\u1ea5t \\u0111\\u1ec3 \\u0111i l&agrave;m v\\u1edbi th\\u01b0 vi\\u1ec7n n&agrave;y. Cu\\u1ed1i kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng 1 d\\u1ef1 &aacute;n ho&agrave;n ch\\u1ec9nh ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n b\\u1eb1ng th\\u01b0 vi\\u1ec7n ReactJS.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><strong>Video gi\\u1edbi thi\\u1ec7u d\\u1ef1 &aacute;n Threads Clone<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><strong>B\\u1ea1n nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c g&igrave; t\\u1ea1i kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc?<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Ki\\u1ebfn th\\u1ee9c c\\u0103n b\\u1ea3n nh\\u1ea5t v\\u1ec1 React JS<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Hi\\u1ec3u r&otilde; b\\u1ea3n ch\\u1ea5t c&aacute;ch ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng c\\u1ee7a c&aacute;c th&agrave;nh ph\\u1ea7n trong React JS th&ocirc;ng qua Class Component<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba R&egrave;n luy\\u1ec7n t\\u01b0 duy l\\u1eadp tr&igrave;nh qua c&aacute;c Case Study \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch trong kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba L&agrave;m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi RESTful API<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba L&agrave;m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi c&aacute;c React Hook t\\u1eeb c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n \\u0111\\u1ebfn n&acirc;ng cao<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Bi\\u1ebft c&aacute;ch t\\u1ef1 x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; Global State<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Bi\\u1ebft c&aacute;ch t\\u1ef1 x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng Hook ri&ecirc;ng trong React JS<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba L&agrave;m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi React Router DOM<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba C&aacute;c k\\u1ef9 thu\\u1eadt l&agrave;m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi Assets v&agrave; c&aacute;c th\\u01b0 vi\\u1ec7n b&ecirc;n th\\u1ee9 ba<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba L&agrave;m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi React Hook Form<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba K\\u1ef9 thu\\u1eadt x\\u1eed l&yacute; Authentication - Authorization (JWT) t\\u1eeb c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n \\u0111\\u1ebfn n&acirc;ng cao<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba T&iacute;ch h\\u1ee3p c&aacute;c th\\u01b0 vi\\u1ec7n x\\u1eed l&yacute; Authentication b&ecirc;n th\\u1ee9 ba: Auth0, Firebase, Clerk,...<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba K\\u1ef9 thu\\u1eadt l&agrave;m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi th\\u01b0 vi\\u1ec7n Redux, Redux Toolkit, Redux Toolkit Query<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba K\\u1ef9 thu\\u1eadt l&agrave;m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi SWR, React Query (Tanstack Query)<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba K\\u1ef9 thu\\u1eadt x\\u1eed l&yacute; v\\u1edbi styled components,&nbsp;Framer Motion, i18n, Socket.IO, Testing,...<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Bi\\u1ebft c&aacute;ch k\\u1ebft h\\u1ee3p Typescript v&agrave;o \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng ReactJS<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba V&agrave; r\\u1ea5t nhi\\u1ec1u ki\\u1ebfn th\\u1ee9c, c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7, th\\u01b0 vi\\u1ec7n ph\\u1ed5 bi\\u1ebfn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c chia s\\u1ebb trong kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><strong>C&acirc;u h\\u1ecfi th\\u01b0\\u1eddng g\\u1eb7p<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><em><strong>Kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc n&agrave;y c\\u1ea7n ki\\u1ebfn th\\u1ee9c n\\u1ec1n g&igrave; kh&ocirc;ng?<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>ReactJS l&agrave; th\\u01b0 vi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ee7a JavaScript n&ecirc;n b\\u1ea1n c\\u1ea7n c&oacute; ki\\u1ebfn th\\u1ee9c v\\u1eefng ch\\u1eafc v\\u1ec1 JavaScript v&agrave; HTML-CSS. B\\u1ea1n vui l&ograve;ng xem b&agrave;i gi\\u1ea3ng mi\\u1ec5n ph&iacute; &quot;<strong>Ki\\u1ebfn th\\u1ee9c c\\u1ea7n chu\\u1ea9n b\\u1ecb tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc khi h\\u1ecdc ReactJS<\\/strong>&quot;<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><em><strong>T&ocirc;i kh&ocirc;ng bi\\u1ebft v\\u1ec1 TypeScript c&oacute; h\\u1ecdc \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c kh&ocirc;ng?<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c, trong kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn v\\u1ec1 TypeScript v&agrave; t\\u1eeb sau module TypeScript m&igrave;nh m\\u1edbi &aacute;p d\\u1ee5ng trong c&aacute;c b&agrave;i h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn. C&ograve;n c&aacute;c n\\u1ed9i d\\u1ee5ng tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc v\\u1eabn s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng JavaScript<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><em><strong>N&ecirc;n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng Vite hay Create React App?<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u1ede th\\u1eddi \\u0111i\\u1ec3m hi\\u1ec7n t\\u1ea1i, Vite \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c chu\\u1ed9ng h\\u01a1n n&ecirc;n b\\u1ea1n c&oacute; th\\u1ec3 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng Vite lu&ocirc;n t\\u1eeb khi b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc. Ph\\u1ea7n \\u0111\\u1ea7u kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc m&igrave;nh s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng Create React App v&igrave; v\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1 th\\u1eddi \\u0111i\\u1ec3m quay, t\\u1ef7 l\\u1ec7 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng Create React App v\\u1eabn ph\\u1ed5 bi\\u1ebfn<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><em><strong>Trong qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh h\\u1ecdc, t&ocirc;i c&oacute; \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c h\\u1ecfi gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n kh&ocirc;ng?<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c, n\\u1ebfu g\\u1eb7p kh&oacute; kh\\u0103n b\\u1ea1n c&oacute; th\\u1ec3 nh\\u1eafn tin tr\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ebfp cho gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n qua Zalo ho\\u1eb7c tr&ecirc;n group \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c tham gia<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><em><strong>T&ocirc;i c\\u1ea7n c&agrave;i \\u0111\\u1eb7t nh\\u1eefng ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m\\/c&ocirc;ng c\\u1ee5 g&igrave; \\u0111\\u1ec3 h\\u1ecdc?<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u0110\\u1ec3 h\\u1ecdc ReactJS b\\u1ea1n c\\u1ea7n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m Visual Studio Code \\u0111\\u1ec3 vi\\u1ebft code v&agrave; c&agrave;i \\u0111\\u1eb7t NodeJS tr&ecirc;n m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh. B\\u1ea1n c&oacute; th\\u1ec3 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m vi\\u1ebft code kh&aacute;c n\\u1ebfu ph&ugrave; h\\u1ee3p<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><em><strong>Trong b&agrave;i gi\\u1ea3ng b\\u1ea1n d&ugrave;ng ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m n&agrave;o \\u0111\\u1ec3 h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn h\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n?<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Trong kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc m&igrave;nh \\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m Visual Studio Code \\u0111\\u1ec3 vi\\u1ebft code, m&igrave;nh c\\u0169ng khuy&ecirc;n b\\u1ea1n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m n&agrave;y v&igrave; n&oacute; h\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 r\\u1ea5t m\\u1ea1nh cho Front-End<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><em><strong>Trong kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc \\u0111ang h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn \\u1edf phi&ecirc;n b\\u1ea3n ReactJS bao nhi&ecirc;u?<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Trong kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc, m&igrave;nh h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn tr&ecirc;n ReactJS 18 v&agrave; b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u t\\u1eeb class \\u0111\\u1ec3 h\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n hi\\u1ec3u \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c t\\u01b0 duy v&agrave; lu\\u1ed3ng ch\\u1ea1y c\\u1ee7a ReactJS<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><em><strong>Kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc n&agrave;y c&ograve;n ph&ugrave; h\\u1ee3p v\\u1edbi th\\u1eddi \\u0111i\\u1ec3m hi\\u1ec7n t\\u1ea1i kh&ocirc;ng?<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc r\\u1ea5t ph&ugrave; h\\u1ee3p v\\u1edbi th\\u1eddi \\u0111i\\u1ec3m hi\\u1ec7n t\\u1ea1i, v&igrave; ph\\u1ea7n l\\u1edbn n\\u1ed9i dung kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc t\\u1eeb ph\\u1ea7n React Hook \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c quay trong n\\u0103m 2024<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><em><strong>Kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc n&agrave;y c&oacute; \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt trong t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng lai kh&ocirc;ng?<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>C&oacute; b\\u1ea1n nh&eacute;. M&igrave;nh s\\u1ebd c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt nh\\u1eefng ki\\u1ebfn th\\u1ee9c m\\u1edbi, t\\u01b0 duy m\\u1edbi trong ReactJS ph&ugrave; h\\u1ee3p v\\u1edbi nhu c\\u1ea7u tuy\\u1ec3n d\\u1ee5ng<\\/p>\",\"detail_en\":\"<p>ReactJS is an open-source JavaScript library developed by a team of engineers from Facebook; it was introduced in 2011.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>React&#39;s design principles are based on a component-based approach, making it reusable and suitable for single-page applications (SPAs). React helps programmers build user interfaces using JSX (an extension of JavaScript), creating virtual DOMs to optimize web page rendering.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The ReactJS course, developed and taught by Hoang An Unicode, equips students with the necessary knowledge to work with this library. At the end of the course, you will be guided to build a complete project entirely using the ReactJS library.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>[Video introducing the Threads Clone project]<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>What will you receive from the course?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Fundamental knowledge of React JS<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Understanding the nature of how React JS components work through Class Components<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Developing programming thinking through case studies analyzed in the course<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Working with RESTful APIs<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Working with React Hooks from basic to advanced levels<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Knowing how to build your own Global State management system<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Knowing how to build your own Hooks in React JS<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Working with React Router DOM<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Techniques for working with Assets and third-party libraries<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Working with React Hook Forms<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Techniques for handling Authentication - Authorization (JWT) from basic to advanced levels<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Integrating third-party authentication libraries: Auth0, Firebase, Clerk, etc.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Techniques for working with Redux, Redux Toolkit, and Redux Toolkit Query<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Techniques for working with SWR and React Query (Tanstack Query)<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Techniques for handling styled components, Framer Motion, i18n, Socket.IO, Testing, etc.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba Knowing how to integrate TypeScript into ReactJS applications<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\u25ba And much more knowledge, technologies, and popular libraries will be shared in the course.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Frequently Asked Questions<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>What prior knowledge is required for this course?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>ReactJS is a JavaScript library, so you need a solid understanding of JavaScript and HTML-CSS. Please see the free lecture &quot;Knowledge to prepare before learning ReactJS&quot;.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>I don&#39;t know TypeScript, can I still learn?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Yes, you will be guided on TypeScript in the course, and we will only apply it in the tutorials after the TypeScript module. The content before that will still use JavaScript.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Should I use Vite or Create React App?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Currently, Vite is more popular, so you can use Vite from the beginning of the course. For the first part of the course, I used Create React App because of the timing of filming, and the usage rate for Create React App was still common.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>During the course, can I ask the instructor questions?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Yes, if you encounter difficulties, you can message the instructor directly via Zalo or in the group you are in.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>What software\\/tools do I need to install to learn?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>To learn ReactJS, you need to use Visual Studio Code to write code and install NodeJS on your computer. You can use other coding software if suitable.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>What software do you use to guide students in the lectures?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>In this course, I am using Visual Studio Code to write code, and I also recommend this software because it has strong support for Front-End development.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>What version of ReactJS is being taught in this course?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>In this course, I teach using ReactJS 18 and start with classes so that students understand the thinking and workflow of ReactJS.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Is this course still relevant today?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Yes, the course is very relevant today, as most of the course content, from the React Hook section onwards, was filmed in 2024.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Will this course be updated in the future?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Yes, it will. I will update it with new knowledge and thinking in ReactJS to meet recruitment needs.<\\/p>\",\"detail_ko\":null,\"detail_ja\":null,\"detail_zh\":null,\"teacher_id\":6,\"thumbnail\":\"\\/storage\\/photos\\/2\\/reactjs-2.jpg\",\"price\":2580000,\"sale_price\":895000,\"code\":\"KH446584\",\"durations\":0,\"is_document\":0,\"supports\":\"<p>Code m\\u1eabu, t&agrave;i li\\u1ec7u \\u0111\\u1ea7y \\u0111\\u1ee7<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>H\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 1-1 b\\u1edfi gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n, nh&oacute;m k&iacute;n<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Gi\\u1edbi thi\\u1ec7u c&ocirc;ng vi\\u1ec7c ph&ugrave; h\\u1ee3p<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Th\\u1eddi h\\u1ea1n: V\\u0129nh vi\\u1ec5n<\\/p>\",\"supports_en\":\"<p>Learn on any device<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Sample code, complete documentation<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>One-on-one support by instructors, private group<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Job placement assistance<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Duration: Lifetime<\\/p>\",\"supports_ko\":\"<p>\\ubaa8\\ub4e0 \\uae30\\uae30\\uc5d0\\uc11c \\ud559\\uc2b5 \\uac00\\ub2a5<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u3059\\u3079\\u3066\\u306e\\u30c7\\u30d0\\u30a4\\u30b9\\u3067\\u5b66\\u7fd2\\u53ef\\u80fd<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\uc608\\uc81c \\ucf54\\ub4dc \\ubc0f \\uc644\\uc804\\ud55c \\ud559\\uc2b5 \\uc790\\ub8cc \\uc81c\\uacf5<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\uac15\\uc0ac\\uc758 1:1 \\uc9c0\\uc6d0 \\ubc0f \\uc804\\uc6a9 \\ucee4\\ubba4\\ub2c8\\ud2f0<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\uc5ed\\ub7c9\\uc5d0 \\ub9de\\ub294 \\ucde8\\uc5c5 \\uae30\\ud68c \\uc81c\\uacf5<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud3c9\\uc0dd \\uc774\\uc6a9 \\uac00\\ub2a5<\\/p>\",\"supports_ja\":\"<p>\\u3059\\u3079\\u3066\\u306e\\u30c7\\u30d0\\u30a4\\u30b9\\u3067\\u5b66\\u7fd2\\u53ef\\u80fd<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u30b5\\u30f3\\u30d7\\u30eb\\u30b3\\u30fc\\u30c9\\u3068\\u5b8c\\u5168\\u306a\\u8cc7\\u6599\\u4ed8\\u304d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u8b1b\\u5e2b\\u306b\\u3088\\u308b1\\u5bfe1\\u30b5\\u30dd\\u30fc\\u30c8\\u3068\\u5c02\\u7528\\u30b3\\u30df\\u30e5\\u30cb\\u30c6\\u30a3<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u30b9\\u30ad\\u30eb\\u306b\\u5408\\u3063\\u305f\\u5c31\\u8077\\u6a5f\\u4f1a\\u306e\\u7d39\\u4ecb<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u7121\\u671f\\u9650\\u30a2\\u30af\\u30bb\\u30b9<\\/p>\",\"supports_zh\":\"<p>\\u652f\\u6301\\u5728\\u6240\\u6709\\u8bbe\\u5907\\u4e0a\\u5b66\\u4e60<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u63d0\\u4f9b\\u793a\\u4f8b\\u4ee3\\u7801\\u548c\\u5b8c\\u6574\\u5b66\\u4e60\\u8d44\\u6599<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u8bb2\\u5e08\\u4e00\\u5bf9\\u4e00\\u6307\\u5bfc\\u53ca\\u4e13\\u5c5e\\u5b66\\u4e60\\u793e\\u7fa4<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u63a8\\u8350\\u9002\\u5408\\u7684\\u5de5\\u4f5c\\u673a\\u4f1a<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u6c38\\u4e45\\u8bbf\\u95ee<\\/p>\",\"status\":1,\"view\":4,\"created_at\":\"2026-02-03T08:51:15.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-24T06:48:18.000000Z\",\"teacher\":{\"id\":6,\"name\":\"Gi\\u1ea3ng vi\\u00ean \\u1ea3o\",\"name_en\":\"Virtual Instructor\",\"name_ko\":\"\\uac00\\uc0c1 \\uac15\\uc0ac\",\"name_ja\":\"\\u30d0\\u30fc\\u30c1\\u30e3\\u30eb\\u8b1b\\u5e2b\",\"name_zh\":\"\\u865a\\u62df\\u8bb2\\u5e08\",\"slug\":\"giang-vien-ao\",\"slug_en\":\"virtual-instructor\",\"slug_ko\":\"\\uac00\\uc0c1-\\uac15\\uc0ac\",\"slug_ja\":\"\\u30d0\\u30fc\\u30c1\\u30e3\\u30eb\\u8b1b\\u5e2b\",\"slug_zh\":\"\\u865a\\u62df\\u8bb2\\u5e08\",\"description\":\"<p><span style=\\\"color:#e74c3c\\\">Fullstack Developer<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o l&agrave; gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n Fullstack v\\u1edbi nhi\\u1ec1u n\\u0103m kinh nghi\\u1ec7m trong l\\u0129nh v\\u1ef1c ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m v&agrave; \\u0111&agrave;o t\\u1ea1o l\\u1eadp tr&igrave;nh vi&ecirc;n t\\u1eeb c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n \\u0111\\u1ebfn n&acirc;ng cao. Anh t\\u1eebng tr\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ebfp tham gia x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng v&agrave; tri\\u1ec3n khai nhi\\u1ec1u d\\u1ef1 &aacute;n web th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf, t\\u1eeb c&aacute;c h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng website doanh nghi\\u1ec7p, n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng th\\u01b0\\u01a1ng m\\u1ea1i \\u0111i\\u1ec7n t\\u1eed \\u0111\\u1ebfn c&aacute;c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng qu\\u1ea3n l&yacute; v&agrave; h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng n\\u1ed9i b\\u1ed9.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>V\\u1edbi n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng v\\u1eefng ch\\u1eafc c\\u1ea3 Front-end v&agrave; Back-end, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o c&oacute; kh\\u1ea3 n\\u0103ng h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn h\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n ti\\u1ebfp c\\u1eadn l\\u1eadp tr&igrave;nh m\\u1ed9t c&aacute;ch b&agrave;i b\\u1ea3n, hi\\u1ec3u r&otilde; b\\u1ea3n ch\\u1ea5t v\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1 thay v&igrave; ch\\u1ec9 l&agrave;m theo m\\u1eabu. N\\u1ed9i dung gi\\u1ea3ng d\\u1ea1y lu&ocirc;n b&aacute;m s&aacute;t nhu c\\u1ea7u th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf c\\u1ee7a doanh nghi\\u1ec7p, c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7 m\\u1edbi v&agrave; t\\u1eadp trung m\\u1ea1nh v&agrave;o k\\u1ef9 n\\u0103ng th\\u1ef1c h&agrave;nh, gi&uacute;p h\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n c&oacute; th\\u1ec3 t\\u1ef1 x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m ho&agrave;n ch\\u1ec9nh ngay trong qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh h\\u1ecdc.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Trong vai tr&ograve; gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t ch&uacute; tr\\u1ecdng \\u0111\\u1ebfn tr\\u1ea3i nghi\\u1ec7m h\\u1ecdc t\\u1eadp c\\u1ee7a h\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n. C&aacute;c b&agrave;i gi\\u1ea3ng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, d\\u1ec5 hi\\u1ec3u, k\\u1ebft h\\u1ee3p gi\\u1eefa l&yacute; thuy\\u1ebft c\\u1ed1t l&otilde;i v&agrave; b&agrave;i t\\u1eadp th\\u1ef1c h&agrave;nh th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf. H\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n kh&ocirc;ng ch\\u1ec9 h\\u1ecdc c&aacute;ch vi\\u1ebft code, m&agrave; c&ograve;n \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn t\\u01b0 duy gi\\u1ea3i quy\\u1ebft v\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1, c&aacute;ch t\\u1ed5 ch\\u1ee9c source code, l&agrave;m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi database, API, c\\u0169ng nh\\u01b0 quy tr&igrave;nh ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m chuy&ecirc;n nghi\\u1ec7p.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>B&ecirc;n c\\u1ea1nh vi\\u1ec7c gi\\u1ea3ng d\\u1ea1y, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o lu&ocirc;n khuy\\u1ebfn kh&iacute;ch h\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n ch\\u1ee7 \\u0111\\u1ed9ng h\\u1ecdc h\\u1ecfi, t\\u1ef1 nghi&ecirc;n c\\u1ee9u v&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng ng\\u1ea1i th\\u1eed nghi\\u1ec7m. Anh tin r\\u1eb1ng l\\u1eadp tr&igrave;nh kh&ocirc;ng ch\\u1ec9 l&agrave; k\\u1ef9 n\\u0103ng k\\u1ef9 thu\\u1eadt, m&agrave; c&ograve;n l&agrave; t\\u01b0 duy logic v&agrave; kh\\u1ea3 n\\u0103ng th&iacute;ch nghi v\\u1edbi s\\u1ef1 thay \\u0111\\u1ed5i c\\u1ee7a c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7. M\\u1ee5c ti&ecirc;u c\\u1ee7a anh l&agrave; gi&uacute;p h\\u1ecdc vi&ecirc;n x&acirc;y d\\u1ef1ng n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng v\\u1eefng ch\\u1eafc, \\u0111\\u1ee7 t\\u1ef1 tin \\u0111\\u1ec3 ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1ee5c ph&aacute;t tri\\u1ec3n s\\u1ef1 nghi\\u1ec7p trong l\\u0129nh v\\u1ef1c c&ocirc;ng ngh\\u1ec7 th&ocirc;ng tin ho\\u1eb7c tham gia v&agrave;o c&aacute;c d\\u1ef1 &aacute;n th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf ngay sau khi ho&agrave;n th&agrave;nh kh&oacute;a h\\u1ecdc.<\\/p>\",\"description_en\":\"<p><span style=\\\"color:#e74c3c\\\">Fullstack Developer<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o is a Fullstack instructor with many years of experience in software development and training programmers from basic to advanced levels. He has directly participated in building and deploying many real-world web projects, from corporate websites and e-commerce platforms to management applications and internal systems.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>With a solid foundation in both Front-end and Back-end development, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o is able to guide students to approach programming in a systematic way, understanding the essence of the problem rather than just following a template. The teaching content always closely follows the real-world needs of businesses, updates new technologies, and strongly focuses on practical skills, helping students build complete products themselves during the learning process.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>As an instructor, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o places particular emphasis on the learning experience of his students. Lectures are designed to be clear, easy to understand, combining core theory with practical exercises. Students not only learn how to write code, but are also guided in problem-solving thinking, source code organization, working with databases and APIs, as well as professional software development processes.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Besides teaching, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi&ecirc;n \\u1ea3o always encourages students to proactively learn, conduct their own research, and not be afraid to experiment. He believes that programming is not just about technical skills, but also about logical thinking and the ability to adapt to technological changes. His goal is to help students build a solid foundation, giving them enough confidence to continue developing their careers in information technology or participate in real-world projects immediately after completing the course.<\\/p>\",\"description_ko\":\"<p><strong>\\ud480\\uc2a4\\ud0dd \\uac1c\\ubc1c\\uc790<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><strong>\\uac00\\uc0c1 \\uac15\\uc0ac<\\/strong>\\ub294 \\uc18c\\ud504\\ud2b8\\uc6e8\\uc5b4 \\uac1c\\ubc1c \\ubd84\\uc57c\\uc5d0\\uc11c \\ub2e4\\ub144\\uac04\\uc758 \\uacbd\\ud5d8\\uc744 \\ubcf4\\uc720\\ud55c \\ud480\\uc2a4\\ud0dd \\uac1c\\ubc1c\\uc790\\ub85c, \\ucd08\\uae09\\ubd80\\ud130 \\uace0\\uae09\\uae4c\\uc9c0 \\ud504\\ub85c\\uadf8\\ub798\\uba38 \\uad50\\uc721\\uc744 \\uc9c4\\ud589\\ud574 \\uc654\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\uadf8\\ub294 \\uae30\\uc5c5 \\uc6f9\\uc0ac\\uc774\\ud2b8, \\uc804\\uc790\\uc0c1\\uac70\\ub798 \\ud50c\\ub7ab\\ud3fc, \\uad00\\ub9ac \\uc2dc\\uc2a4\\ud15c \\ubc0f \\ub0b4\\ubd80 \\uc2dc\\uc2a4\\ud15c \\ub4f1 \\ub2e4\\uc591\\ud55c \\uc2e4\\uc81c \\uc6f9 \\ud504\\ub85c\\uc81d\\ud2b8\\ub97c \\uc9c1\\uc811 \\uad6c\\ucd95\\ud558\\uace0 \\uc6b4\\uc601\\ud55c \\uacbd\\ud5d8\\uc774 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>\\ud504\\ub860\\ud2b8\\uc5d4\\ub4dc\\uc640 \\ubc31\\uc5d4\\ub4dc \\ubaa8\\ub450\\uc5d0 \\ub300\\ud55c \\ud0c4\\ud0c4\\ud55c \\uae30\\ubc18\\uc744 \\ubc14\\ud0d5\\uc73c\\ub85c, \\uac00\\uc0c1 \\uac15\\uc0ac\\ub294 \\ud559\\uc2b5\\uc790\\ub4e4\\uc774 \\ub2e8\\uc21c\\ud788 \\uc608\\uc81c\\ub97c \\ub530\\ub77c \\ud558\\ub294 \\uac83\\uc774 \\uc544\\ub2c8\\ub77c \\u